"value\":276},\"Frequently Asked Questions\",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":278,\"props\":279,\"children\":281},\"h3\",{\"id\":280},\"can-i-compress-an-image-to-exactly-50kb\",[282],{\"type\":22,\"value\":283},\"Can I compress an image to exactly 50KB?\",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":25,\"props\":285,\"children\":286},{},[287,289,294],{\"type\":22,\"value\":288},\"Yes! In the \\\"Max File Size\\\" setting, simply slide it down to \",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":196,\"props\":290,\"children\":292},{\"className\":291},[],[293],{\"type\":22,\"value\":218},{\"type\":22,\"value\":295},\" MB (which is 50KB). The compressor will adjust the quality and dimensions to try and meet that target.\",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":278,\"props\":297,\"children\":299},{\"id\":298},\"does-it-support-bulk-compression\",[300],{\"type\":22,\"value\":301},\"Does it support bulk compression?\",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":25,\"props\":303,\"children\":304},{},[305,307,312],{\"type\":22,\"value\":306},\"Currently, we focus on \",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":44,\"props\":308,\"children\":309},{},[310],{\"type\":22,\"value\":311},\"single-image precision\",{\"type\":22,\"value\":313},\". We want to give you the perfect result for that one important file rather than doing a mediocre job on 50 files at once.\",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":278,\"props\":315,\"children\":317},{\"id\":316},\"will-my-image-look-bad\",[318],{\"type\":22,\"value\":319},\"Will my image look bad?\",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":25,\"props\":321,\"children\":322},{},[323],{\"type\":22,\"value\":324},\"Not necessarily. Our \\\"Smart\\\" algorithm tries to reduce file size by removing invisible metadata and optimizing encoding first. If you ask for an extreme reduction (e.g., 5MB down to 10KB), then yes, quality will drop, but for standard use cases (e.g., 2MB to 200KB), the difference is often unnoticeable.\",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":79,\"props\":326,\"children\":328},{\"id\":327},\"ready-to-save-space\",[329],{\"type\":22,\"value\":330},\"Ready to Save Space?\",{\"type\":16,\"tag\":25,\"prop